    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for any handlers passed to <ref refid="namespacesg_1a543dfbe726e9dc7d77e792bdeea1ed67" kindref="member">dispatch</ref>. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>struct <ref refid="structsg_1_1DispatchHandler" kindref="compound">DispatchHandler</ref></para><para>This templated class should be used as a BaseClass for Handlers passed to dispatch. &quot;handle&quot; functions will have to be implemented for each possible type to be handled. <computeroutput>_ReturnType</computeroutput> holds any data that should be returned from the handlers. </para>    </detaileddescription>
